                            Meta Tags

        It is nothing about the data of the web page 
                            or
        The data about data

        |- <meta />  --- it is self closing Tags
        |- Attributes:
            |- charset --- UTF-8,16,32
            |- name
                |- 1. viewport --- screen sizes

                |- 2. author  --- owner of the page or something

                |- 3. keywords --- which helpful to identify the page easily

                |- 4. description  --- to describe to the web page 

                |- 5. http-equiv --- allows you to provide processing instructions for the browser as if the response that returned the document included certain HTTP headers


            |- content 
                |-1. width = device-width
                |-1. initial-scale = 1.0

                |-2. Owner Name, CompanyName..,

                |-3. related to our webpage search (trending words) such as web, frontend, backend, full-stack...,

                |-4. It is a leaning platform to learn web related technologies and build the real-time apps, web applications ...,
